From 6de5fa3190f28c4e998f3e388bd0e22381032403 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: KaulSays <267474517+AeviaDigital@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NVR: rebuild shape engine (30 primitives) + rewrite all 6
 templates

- Add js/nvr-shapes.js: composite SVG engine (primitives, 6 fill patterns,
  positioned decorations, multi-element scene compositor)
- Add js/nvr-templates-v2.js: rewrite Series, Odd One Out, Mirror Image,
  Matrix, Shape Analogy, Shape Codes on the new engine; richer distractor
  logic and multi-attribute transforms (rotation+pattern combined, etc.)
- Trim js/nvr-visual.js to shared helpers only (NVR_VISUAL_TOPICS, nvrPick,
  nvrShuffle, nvrEasy); old single-primitive engine/templates removed after
  confirming via grep nothing else referenced them
- index.html: load nvr-shapes.js + nvr-templates-v2.js after nvr-visual.js

Stress-tested 3000-5000x per template (real files, real load order): 0
crashes, 0 duplicate options, 0 correct-index bugs. Fixed 2 bugs found during
testing (Mirror Image 5-option overflow, Analogy decoration-mode crash) and
2 shape-symmetry issues found during asymmetry checks (trapezoid/heart mirror
no-ops, plusUneven axis mismatch).
